  "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\"></p><div class=\"Box Box--condensed my-2\">\n  <div class=\"Box-header f6\">\n    <p class=\"mb-0 text-bold\">\n      <a href=\"https://github.com/dart-lang/sdk/blob/f9278779f770cf87b0cbbd7bd4d1fe127d6fe69f/sdk/lib/_http/http_impl.dart#L3385\">sdk/sdk/lib/_http/http_impl.dart</a>\n    </p>\n    <p class=\"mb-0 color-fg-muted\">\n         Line 3385\n      in\n      <a data-pjax=\"true\" class=\"commit-tease-sha Link--inTextBlock\" href=\"/dart-lang/sdk/commit/f9278779f770cf87b0cbbd7bd4d1fe127d6fe69f\">f927877</a>\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <div itemprop=\"text\" class=\"Box-body p-0 blob-wrapper blob-wrapper-embedded data\">\n    <table class=\"highlight tab-size mb-0 js-file-line-container\" data-tab-size=\"8\" data-paste-markdown-skip=\"\">\n\n        <tbody><tr class=\"border-0\">\n          <td id=\"L3385\" class=\"blob-num border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default\" data-line-number=\"3385\"></td>\n          <td id=\"LC3385\" class=\"blob-code border-0 tmp-px-3 py-0 color-bg-default blob-code-inner js-file-line\"> _httpServer.defaultResponseHeaders, </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody></table>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<p></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The default response headers set a content-type even in cases when they shouldn't.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">See RFC 9110</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Suggestion: drop the default content header if the body is empty?</p>",
