   "html_url": "https://github.com/dart-lang/sdk/issues/60768#issuecomment-3002164447",
   "body_html": "<p dir=\"auto\">What part of RFC-9110 are you referring to. <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html#field.content-type\" rel=\"nofollow\">8.3</a> says:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">A sender that generates a message containing content SHOULD generate a Content-Type header field in that message unless the intended media type of the enclosed representation is unknown to the sender.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AFAIK, there is no advice when no body is sent.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">For the linked flutter issue, should Flutter be setting the content-type explicitly?</p>",
   "body_text": "What part of RFC-9110 are you referring to. 8.3 says:\n\nA sender that generates a message containing content SHOULD generate a Content-Type header field in that message unless the intended media type of the enclosed representation is unknown to the sender.\n\nAFAIK, there is no advice when no body is sent.\nFor the linked flutter issue, should Flutter be setting the content-type explicitly?",
